    <title>Protein Structure Prediction with Deep Learning</title>
    <summary>This paper presents a novel approach to protein structure prediction
    using deep learning techniques. We leverage transformer architectures to predict
    3D protein structures from amino acid sequences with improved accuracy.</summary>
    <author><name>David Brown</name></author>
