  <entry>
    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/2503.11111v1</id>
    <updated>2026-03-28T10:00:00Z</updated>
    <published>2026-03-28T10:00:00Z</published>
    <title>Efficient RAG Systems with Sparse Retrieval</title>
    <summary>We propose an efficient retrieval augmented generation system that
    combines sparse retrieval mechanisms with dense embeddings. Our approach achieves
    state-of-the-art performance on multiple QA benchmarks while reducing latency
    by 40% compared to existing RAG methods.</summary>
    <author><name>Eve Davis</name></author>
    <author><name>Frank Miller</name></author>
